@host = http://localhost:5011
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 0. Login (Development default: admin / admin)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin" }

### 1. Health check (public)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 2. Search teams on API-Football (costs 1 request)
GET {{host}}/api/watchlist/search-teams?q=manchester
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Add tracked team (Manchester United)
POST {{host}}/api/watchlist/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalApiId": 33,
  "name": "Manchester United",
  "country": "England",
  "leagueExternalId": 39
}

### 4. Add search keyword alias (entityId = internal team id from step 3)
POST {{host}}/api/watchlist/aliases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "Team",
  "entityId": 1,
  "keyword": "Manchester United",
  "language": "en"
}

### 5. Pause tracking a team
PATCH {{host}}/api/watchlist/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isTracked": false }

### 6. Trigger news collection (admin token; cron-job.org uses X-Cron-Secret instead)
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/run?mode=news
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. View collected news
GET {{host}}/api/news?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Check daily API quota
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/quota
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
